  body: "# Winter Fuel Payment guidance for the stated 2024–2025 period\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nThe later
    chapter 40 section describes Winter Fuel Payment rules introduced for winter 2024, including a relevant-benefit
    or tax-credit route for the stated territorial branch.\n\n## Scope and exceptions\n\nThe warning above DMG 40031
    says the section no longer applies from 16 September 2025; do not use its words “onwards” without that warning.
    The eligible-country branch is separately said to cease on 1 April 2025. Chapter 39 starts its later section
    on 15 September 2025, leaving a source boundary discrepancy. No means test is copied into a later winter.\n\n\
    ## Inspected passages\n\n- [DMG 40031, PDF page 10](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68d6a588620e762dc586644e/dmg-ch-40.pdf#page=10).\n\
    - [DMG 40034, PDF page 10](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68d6a588620e762dc586644e/dmg-ch-40.pdf#page=10).\n\
    - [DMG 40035, PDF page 11](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68d6a588620e762dc586644e/dmg-ch-40.pdf#page=11).\n\
    \n## Additional context\n\n- [Context: chapter 40, PDF page 10](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68d6a588620e762dc586644e/dmg-ch-40.pdf#page=10).\n\
    - [Context: chapter 40, PDF page 11](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68d6a588620e762dc586644e/dmg-ch-40.pdf#page=11).\n\
    - [Context: chapter 40, PDF page 12](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68d6a588620e762dc586644e/dmg-ch-40.pdf#page=12).\n\
    \n## Evidence and review status\n\nIndependent experimental interpretation of captured DWP guidance, not an
    official DWP document. Definitions and semantic associations are model-assisted proposals awaiting specialist
    review. No individual entitlement decision, medical conclusion, award calculation or executable rule is provided.\n\
    \nSource observation, listing-page update, printed revision, legal event and claimant-event dates are separate.
    Current legal applicability is unresolved. Page numbers are one-based PDF positions; machine extraction may
    damage reading order, characters and footnotes. No visual PDF or specialist acceptance is claimed.\n\n- `dmg-vol7-ch40`:
    PDF `9b76037acc6c9d2fc308b1cf7f834f2d023277e0a08757925e62255b3aa71dd3`; extracted pages `3e67a94776dd0edb568cbaca4d63bfef2587ca81bb5b154aad552d488c8de249`;
    acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:28.419769Z`.\n"
  resource: https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68d6a588620e762dc586644e/dmg-ch-40.pdf#page=10
